{"id":"4709","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4709_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这层薄薄的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>覆盖了大面积的天空，是层状云种。它足够薄，能够显示太阳的位置（透光云云类）和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云元素之间的间隙</span>可以看到天空（漏隙云云类）。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">细长元素</span>的存在几乎彼此平行，显示出多种类型的波纹。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tze Ching Ho","location":"中国香港九龙城","latitude":"纬度: 22° 19' 51'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 11' 28'' E","date":"28 February 2016 0705 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/4709_upper_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>该高空剖面显示480 hPa压力水平附近的浅湿层，表明一层较薄的高积云处于约6000米的高度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5479_main_altocumulus-stratiformus-translucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>该云为广大的薄云片（成层云种），合并的云素大致平行线排列（波状云类）。透过云层可轻易看到天空，可确定为透光云类。在一行行合并的云素之间的空隙还可看到蓝天（漏隙云类）。其颜色以白色为主，但在后部边缘附近呈浅灰色，这是由于云较厚以及太阳的角度低。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛，圣布雷拉德，拉普隆特","latitude":"纬度: 49° 11' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 13' 33'' W","date":"25 November 2012 1626 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.1"}]}]}